<h1>About Sadav RA AI</h1>

<p><strong>Version:</strong> 1.0.0</p>

<p>
<strong>Sadav RA AI</strong> is an advanced AI-powered educational learning platform developed by <strong>Manjun Brand</strong>. The application is designed to provide students, teachers, professionals, and lifelong learners with intelligent academic assistance across multiple subjects.
</p>

<h2>Our Mission</h2>

<p>
Our mission is to make high-quality education accessible to everyone through artificial intelligence. We aim to simplify learning by delivering accurate explanations, quick revisions, flashcards, practice MCQs, and interactive study support.
</p>

<h2>Our Vision</h2>

<p>
Our vision is to become one of the most trusted AI-powered educational platforms, helping learners improve knowledge, build confidence, and achieve academic success through innovative technology.
</p>

<h2>Key Features</h2>

<ul>
<li>AI-powered answers across multiple subjects.</li>
<li>Simple and detailed explanations.</li>
<li>Flashcards for quick learning.</li>
<li>Topic-based MCQs for self-assessment.</li>
<li>Fast, secure, and user-friendly interface.</li>
<li>Continuous improvements and feature updates.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Supported Subjects</h2>

<p>
Sadav RA AI supports learning across Nursing, Medical, Science, Engineering, Mathematics, Business, Programming, School Education, College Education, Competitive Exams, Languages, General Knowledge, and many other academic and professional subjects.
</p>

